      "title": "Algorithm 1: Online Group-Balanced Assignment\nInput: Cross-node traffic load of each GPU\nOutput: Group assignments G\n1 for each node n do\n2 Pn \u2190 sort local GPUs by descending load\n3 for each node n do\n4 Sn \u2190 circular shift of Pn by node index n\n5 for each group gi \u2208 G do\n6 for each node n do\n7 assign the GPU at position i in Sn to group gi\n;\n8 return G",
